# One exception, deliberately narrow. `examples/data/` holds the single small
# ETH/USDC dataset the committed report and the README images are built from,
# so both stay reproducible without a Fynd. Its provenance is in the README
# beside it. The parquet the notebook writes there stays ignored.
!/examples/data/*.jsonl

